<title>USA: Chase unit to advise Caspian pipeline project.</title>
<headline>Chase unit to advise Caspian pipeline project.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp said its affiliate Chase Manhattan Investment Bank Ltd has been appointed financial advisor to a consortium of eight Western, Russian and Kazakhstan oil companies in building and operating the Caspian pipeline in Russia and Kazakhstan.</p>
<p>The pipeline will give Russia more oil exporting capacity and enable Kazakhstan to become a major exporter to Western markets, Chase said.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
